From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 17:09:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): quarantine keeps unrelated deletes flowing;
 owner-visible hold with a real release path [daveey]

Review r2 on 55e25b6b75: sendable() pinned every unrelated chat-link/attachment delete pending
(no task identity on a delete envelope) once any quarantine row existed; the hold was silent and
its refusal named resume-contained, which cannot release it.
- deletes with no identifiable task are sent (cannot release a hold); unidentifiable tables stay pending
- refusal text names the receipt and 'sync quarantine --release'; status shows quarantined count
- new 'hermes kanban sync quarantine [--release RECEIPT --reason TEXT]' (live + shadow)
- file_holds fails closed; restore consumes its checkpoint file
